<title>USA: CACI International awarded $28.2 mln pact.</title>
<headline>CACI International awarded $28.2 mln pact.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Va. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>CACI International Inc said Tuesday it has been awarded a $28.2 million contract by the Justice Department to provide records-management support to the agency's civil division.</p>
<p>The contract contains one base year and four one-year options. The company is expected to begin work on December 1 at the agency's facilities in New York City and the Washington metropolitan area.</p>
